{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"mdeet-2020-biology-02","exam":"MDEET","year":2020,"subject":"biology","number":2,"points":4,"unitId":"signaling","unitLabel":"세포 신호전달","topic":"인산화효소·인산화","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["signaling","cell","biomol"],"stem":"세포 주기 중 M기에 작용하는 M-Cdk의 활성은 인산화효소 a와 b, \n탈인산화효소 c에 의해 직접 조절된다. 다음은 M-Cdk가 들어 \n있는 시험관에 a～c를 표와 같이 첨가했을 때의 M-Cdk 활성을 \n나타낸 것이다.\n첨가한 \n없음\na\nb\nc\na, b\na, c\nb, c\na, b, c\n효소\nM-Cdk \n－\n＋\n－\n－\n－\n＋\n㉠\n＋\n활성\n(－: 없음, ＋: 있음)\n이에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 고른 것은?\n<보 기>\nㄱ. c는 a에 의해 결합된 M-Cdk의 인산기를 제거한다.\nㄴ. ㉠은 ‘－’ 이다.\nㄷ. a와 b는 M-Cdk의 같은 자리에 있는 아미노산 잔기를 \n인산화한다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023","t024","t025","t026","t027","t028","t029","t030","t031"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t032"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t033"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t034"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t035"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t036"]}],"answer":2,"acceptedAnswers":[2],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":776,"height":175,"region":0,"bbox":[14.3,83.663,310.4,70.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023","t024"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2020-biology-02/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":776,"height":236,"region":0,"bbox":[14.3,224.463,310.4,94.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t027","t028","t029","t030","t031"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2020-biology-02/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":2,"sourceRect":[82.9,735.137,417.0,1084.941],"width":334.1,"height":349.804,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","